    <solution><alert> Solution:</alert> 



This is a midpoint Riemann sum.  Its value is:
<me>f(0.2) \cdot 0.4 + 
  f(0.6) \cdot 0.4 + 
  f(1) \cdot 0.4 + 
  f(1.4) \cdot 0.4 + 
  f(1.8) \cdot 0.4</me>
<me>= \left( 1.14869835499704 + 1.5157165665104 + 2 + 2.63901582154579 + 3.4822022531845 \right)
  \cdot 0.4</me>
<me>= 4.31425.</me>





